        <briefdescription>
<para>Load dbgeng.dll from the given sidecar directory. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Calls LoadLibraryW on &quot;&lt;sidecarDirectory&gt;/dbgeng.dll&quot; and resolves the &quot;DebugCreate&quot; export. On success <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_loader_1a62ba00feaf2f23de7bfdf46767f2e493" kindref="member">createDebugClient()</ref> may be called.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sidecarDirectory</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Directory containing dbgeng.dll and its dependencies. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if the DLL was loaded and DebugCreate was resolved successfully.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Calling <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_loader_1af874ec96d883550b797dd61c64499812" kindref="member">load()</ref> more than once is undefined. Create a new <ref refid="classdebug_1_1_loader" kindref="compound">Loader</ref> instead. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
